#: ../doc/recording.rst:242
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Deskripsi"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:154 ../doc/recording.rst:244
msgid "Input"
msgstr "Input"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:154
msgid "System input"
msgstr "Input sistem"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:154
msgid "Selects the microphone or audio-input device."
msgstr "Memilih mikrofon atau perangkat input audio."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:155
msgid "Format"
msgstr "Format"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:155
msgid "FLAC"
msgstr "FLAC"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:155
msgid ""
"Chooses WAV, FLAC, or MP3. FLAC is lossless with smaller files than WAV."
msgstr ""
"Memilih WAV, FLAC, atau MP3. FLAC adalah lossless dengan ukuran file lebih "
"kecil daripada WAV."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:156
msgid "Sample Rate"
msgstr "Laju Sampel"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:156
msgid "48000 Hz"
msgstr "48000 Hz"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:156
msgid ""
"Sets the recording sample rate. Match the device and project when possible."
msgstr ""
"Mengatur laju sampel perekaman. Sesuaikan dengan perangkat dan proyek jika "
"memungkinkan."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:157
msgid "Channels"
msgstr "Saluran"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:157
msgid "Mono"
msgstr "Mono"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:157
msgid ""
"Records one or two input channels. Mono is usually best for one microphone."
msgstr ""
"Merekam satu atau dua saluran input. Mono biasanya terbaik untuk satu "
"mikrofon."

# Main-window terminology review, 2026-09-26.
#: ../doc/recording.rst:160
msgid ""
"Aim for a healthy meter response without clipping. A quiet waveform should "
"remain visually quiet; OpenShot no longer normalizes every newly generated "
"waveform to full height. The lighter peak envelope highlights transients "
"while the solid RMS envelope summarizes sustained energy. Their detail is "
"controlled by :guilabel:`Edit → Preferences → Timeline → Waveform Samples "
"(per second)`. See :ref:`clip_presets_ref` for waveform display and audio "
"volume controls after recording."
msgstr ""
"Usahakan respons meter yang sehat tanpa kliping. Gelombang yang tenang harus"
" tetap terlihat tenang; OpenShot tidak lagi menormalkan setiap gelombang "
"baru ke tinggi penuh. Amplop puncak yang lebih terang menyoroti transien "
"sementara amplop RMS padat merangkum energi yang berkelanjutan. Detailnya "
"dikontrol oleh :guilabel:`Edit → Preferences → Garis Waktu → Waveform "
"Samples (per second)`. Lihat :ref:`clip_presets_ref` untuk tampilan "
"gelombang dan kontrol volume audio setelah perekaman."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:167
msgid "Screen Recording"
msgstr "Perekaman Layar"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:169
msgid "Enable :guilabel:`Screen`, then choose a capture mode:"
msgstr "Aktifkan :guilabel:`Screen`, lalu pilih mode tangkapan:"

