#: ../doc/recording.rst:175
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Mode"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:177
msgid "Full Screen"
msgstr "Layar Penuh"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:177
msgid "Captures the selected display or combined desktop area."
msgstr "Menangkap tampilan yang dipilih atau area desktop gabungan."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:178
msgid "Window"
msgstr "Jendela"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:178
msgid ""
"Click a window to capture its bounds. Availability and exact behavior depend"
" on the platform."
msgstr ""
"Klik sebuah jendela untuk menangkap batasnya. Ketersediaan dan perilaku "
"tepat tergantung pada platform."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:179
msgid "Region"
msgstr "Wilayah"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:179
msgid ""
"Drag or select a rectangular desktop area. Availability depends on the "
"platform."
msgstr ""
"Seret atau pilih area desktop berbentuk persegi panjang. Ketersediaan "
"tergantung pada platform."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:182
msgid ""
"On Wayland desktops, the operating system's sharing portal asks which screen"
" or window to share when recording starts. The numeric window and region "
"controls are hidden because selection belongs to that portal."
msgstr ""
"Pada desktop Wayland, portal berbagi sistem operasi menanyakan layar atau "
"jendela mana yang akan dibagikan saat perekaman dimulai. Kontrol jendela dan"
" wilayah numerik disembunyikan karena pemilihan menjadi milik portal "
"tersebut."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:186
msgid "Screen Advanced Options"
msgstr "Opsi Lanjutan Layar"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:188
msgid "Screen options"
msgstr "Opsi layar"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:192
msgid "Default"
msgstr "Default"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:194
msgid "Primary display"
msgstr "Tampilan utama"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:194
msgid "Selects a display or the complete desktop when supported."
msgstr "Memilih tampilan atau desktop lengkap jika didukung."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:195
msgid "Offset"
msgstr "Offset"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:195 ../doc/recording.rst:196
msgid "Selected bounds"
msgstr "Batas terpilih"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:195
msgid "Sets the capture area's X and Y desktop coordinates."
msgstr "Mengatur koordinat X dan Y area tangkapan di desktop."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:196 ../doc/recording.rst:248
msgid "Size"
msgstr "Ukuran"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:196
msgid ""
"Sets capture width and height. OpenShot uses encoder-safe even dimensions."
msgstr ""
"Mengatur lebar dan tinggi tangkapan. OpenShot menggunakan dimensi genap yang"
" aman untuk encoder."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:197
msgid "FPS"
msgstr "FPS"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:197
msgid "30"
msgstr "30"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:197
msgid "Sets the screen recording frame rate: 15, 24, 30, or 60 FPS."
msgstr "Mengatur laju bingkai perekaman layar: 15, 24, 30, atau 60 FPS."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:198 ../doc/recording.rst:211
msgid "System Audio"
msgstr "Audio Sistem"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:198 ../doc/recording.rst:199
msgid "On"
msgstr "Aktif"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:198
msgid "Embeds computer playback audio in the screen MP4 when supported."
msgstr ""
"Menyematkan audio pemutaran komputer ke dalam MP4 layar saat didukung."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:199
msgid "Cursor"
msgstr "Kursor"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:199
msgid "Includes the mouse pointer in the screen recording."
msgstr "Menyertakan penunjuk mouse dalam rekaman layar."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:200
msgid "Hide OpenShot"
msgstr "Sembunyikan OpenShot"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:200
msgid "No"
msgstr "Tidak"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:200
msgid ""
"Temporarily hides OpenShot during selection and recording when enabled."
msgstr ""
"Sementara menyembunyikan OpenShot selama pemilihan dan perekaman saat "
"diaktifkan."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:205
msgid ""
"On some Windows systems using high-DPI display scaling, the mouse pointer "
"may be displaced or missing from screen recordings made on a scaled display."
" If pointer visibility is important, record on a display configured at 100% "
"scaling, temporarily set the target display to 100%, or use a separate "
"screen-capture application. Screen video is still recorded normally, and "
"setting :guilabel:`Cursor` to :guilabel:`Off` avoids the affected pointer "
"overlay."
msgstr ""
"Pada beberapa sistem Windows yang menggunakan penskalaan tampilan DPI "
"tinggi, penunjuk mouse mungkin bergeser atau hilang dari rekaman layar yang "
"dibuat pada tampilan yang diskalakan. Jika visibilitas penunjuk penting, "
"rekam pada tampilan yang dikonfigurasi dengan penskalaan 100%, sementara "
"atur tampilan target ke 100%, atau gunakan aplikasi tangkapan layar "
"terpisah. Video layar tetap direkam secara normal, dan mengatur "
":guilabel:`Cursor` ke :guilabel:`Off` menghindari overlay penunjuk yang "
"terpengaruh."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:213
msgid ""
":guilabel:`System Audio` is enabled by default on supported capture "
"backends. It records sound playing through the computer—such as a game, "
"browser, media player, or presentation—inside the screen recording. It does "
"not replace the Mic source. Enable both sources when you want system audio "
"and commentary on independently editable clips."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Audio Sistem` diaktifkan secara default pada backend tangkapan "
"yang didukung. Ini merekam suara yang diputar melalui komputer—seperti game,"
" browser, pemutar media, atau presentasi—di dalam rekaman layar. Ini tidak "
"menggantikan sumber Mic. Aktifkan kedua sumber saat Anda menginginkan audio "
"sistem dan komentar pada klip yang dapat diedit secara terpisah."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:217
msgid ""
"If the control is disabled, the active platform or libopenshot build does "
"not provide system-audio capture. OpenShot forces the option Off rather than"
" producing a misleading silent audio track. Operating-system privacy "
"settings and audio-routing configuration can also affect capture."
msgstr ""
"Jika kontrol dinonaktifkan, platform aktif atau build libopenshot tidak "
"menyediakan tangkapan audio sistem. OpenShot memaksa opsi Mati daripada "
"menghasilkan trek audio senyap yang menyesatkan. Pengaturan privasi sistem "
"operasi dan konfigurasi pengalihan audio juga dapat memengaruhi tangkapan."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:223
msgid ""
"System Audio recording is not currently available on macOS. Screen video, "
"microphone, and webcam recording remain available, but the :guilabel:`System"
" Audio` option is disabled and forced to :guilabel:`Off`."
msgstr ""
"Perekaman Audio Sistem saat ini tidak tersedia di macOS. Video layar, "
"mikrofon, dan perekaman webcam tetap tersedia, tetapi opsi :guilabel:`Audio "
"Sistem` dinonaktifkan dan dipaksa ke :guilabel:`Mati`."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:228
msgid ""
"Avoid playing captured system audio through speakers while also recording a "
"microphone unless that sound is intentional. Headphones reduce echo and "
"prevent the microphone from recording the speakers a second time."
msgstr ""
"Hindari memutar audio sistem yang ditangkap melalui speaker saat juga "
"merekam mikrofon kecuali suara tersebut disengaja. Headphone mengurangi gema"
" dan mencegah mikrofon merekam speaker untuk kedua kalinya."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:232
msgid "Webcam Recording"
msgstr "Perekaman Webcam"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:234
msgid ""
"Enable :guilabel:`Webcam` to record a camera as a silent video clip. A live "
"preview helps verify framing before you start. When Screen is also enabled, "
"the default layout is a rounded, 30% camera in the bottom-right corner. When"
" the webcam is recorded alone, it defaults to full size."
msgstr ""
"Aktifkan :guilabel:`Webcam` untuk merekam kamera sebagai klip video tanpa "
"suara. Pratinjau langsung membantu memverifikasi bingkai sebelum Anda mulai."
" Saat Layar juga diaktifkan, tata letak default adalah kamera bulat 30% di "
"sudut kanan bawah. Saat webcam direkam sendiri, ukurannya default penuh."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:238
msgid "Webcam options"
msgstr "Opsi Webcam"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:244
msgid "Selects an available webcam or video-capture device."
msgstr "Memilih webcam atau perangkat tangkap video yang tersedia."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:245
msgid "Resolution"
msgstr "Resolusi"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:245
msgid "Selects a resolution reported by the camera."
msgstr "Memilih resolusi yang dilaporkan oleh kamera."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:246
msgid "Record FPS"
msgstr "Rekam FPS"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:246
msgid "Selects a frame rate supported at the chosen resolution."
msgstr "Memilih kecepatan bingkai yang didukung pada resolusi yang dipilih."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:247
msgid "Layout"
msgstr "Tata Letak"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:247
msgid ""
"Chooses Bottom/Top Left/Right, Left, Right, Center, or Full Size placement."
msgstr ""
"Memilih penempatan Bawah/Atas Kiri/Kanan, Kiri, Kanan, Tengah, atau Ukuran "
"Penuh."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:248
msgid "Sets a corner camera to 20%, 30%, or 40% of the project frame."
msgstr "Mengatur kamera sudut ke 20%, 30%, atau 40% dari bingkai proyek."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:249
msgid "Corners"
msgstr "Sudut"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:249
msgid "Uses Rectangle, Rounded, or Oval camera corners."
msgstr "Menggunakan sudut kamera Persegi Panjang, Bulat, atau Oval."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:252
msgid ""
"Layout choices are applied as ordinary clip properties. After recording, use"
" :guilabel:`Gravity`, :guilabel:`Scale X`, :guilabel:`Scale Y`, "
":guilabel:`Margin`, and :guilabel:`Corner Radius` to refine the result. See "
":ref:`clip_properties_ref`."
msgstr ""
"Pilihan tata letak diterapkan sebagai properti klip biasa. Setelah merekam, "
"gunakan :guilabel:`Gravity`, :guilabel:`Scale X`, :guilabel:`Scale Y`, "
":guilabel:`Margin`, dan :guilabel:`Corner Radius` untuk menyempurnakan "
"hasil. Lihat :ref:`clip_properties_ref`."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:257
msgid "Combining Sources"
msgstr "Menggabungkan Sumber"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:259
msgid ""
"The Recording View keeps all enabled source controls together while leaving "
"the preview and timeline visible."
msgstr ""
"Tampilan Perekaman menjaga semua kontrol sumber yang diaktifkan bersama-sama"
" sambil membiarkan pratinjau dan garis waktu tetap terlihat."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:-1
msgid ""
"OpenShot Recording View with microphone, screen, and webcam sources selected"
msgstr ""
"Tampilan Perekaman OpenShot dengan sumber mikrofon, layar, dan webcam "
"dipilih"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:264
msgid "Useful recording combinations"
msgstr "Kombinasi perekaman yang berguna"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:268
msgid "Workflow"
msgstr "Alur Kerja"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:269
msgid "Enable"
msgstr "Aktifkan"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:270
msgid "Result"
msgstr "Hasil"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:271
msgid "Voice-over"
msgstr "Sulih Suara"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:273
msgid "One editable narration file."
msgstr "Satu file narasi yang dapat diedit."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:274
msgid "Silent tutorial"
msgstr "Tutorial tanpa suara"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:276
msgid "Screen MP4; turn System Audio Off if silence is desired."
msgstr "MP4 Layar; matikan Audio Sistem jika menginginkan keheningan."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:277
msgid "Game commentary"
msgstr "Komentar permainan"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:278
msgid "Mic + Screen"
msgstr "Mic + Layar"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:279
msgid "Separate mic clip plus screen video with game audio."
msgstr "Klip mic terpisah plus video layar dengan audio permainan."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:280
msgid "Presenter camera"
msgstr "Kamera presenter"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:281
msgid "Mic + Webcam"
msgstr "Mic + Webcam"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:282
msgid "Separate voice and silent camera video."
msgstr "Suara terpisah dan video kamera tanpa suara."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:283
msgid "Tutorial with camera"
msgstr "Tutorial dengan kamera"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:284
msgid "Mic + Screen + Webcam"
msgstr "Mic + Layar + Webcam"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:285
msgid "Three synchronized clips with webcam above the screen."
msgstr "Tiga klip sinkron dengan webcam di atas layar."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:288
msgid "Where Recordings Are Saved"
msgstr "Tempat Rekaman Disimpan"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:290
msgid ""
"Recordings are saved in the project's assets folder under ``recordings``. If"
" the project has not been saved yet, OpenShot uses its user-data location. "
"Filenames contain the source name and a timestamp; another numeric suffix "
"avoids overwriting a file created during the same second."
msgstr ""
"Rekaman disimpan di folder aset proyek di bawah ``recordings``. Jika proyek "
"belum disimpan, OpenShot menggunakan lokasi data pengguna. Nama file berisi "
"nama sumber dan cap waktu; sufiks numerik lain menghindari penimpaan file "
"yang dibuat pada detik yang sama."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:294
msgid ""
"Save the project before a long or important session so its recording "
"destination is predictable. Do not move or rename recorded files outside "
"OpenShot while the project is using them."
msgstr ""
"Simpan proyek sebelum sesi panjang atau penting agar tujuan rekamannya dapat"
" diprediksi. Jangan pindahkan atau ganti nama file rekaman di luar OpenShot "
"saat proyek sedang menggunakannya."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:298
msgid "Permissions and Platform Behavior"
msgstr "Izin dan Perilaku Platform"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:300
msgid ""
"Screen and camera capture depend on operating-system services, hardware, and"
" build support. The controls in the dock adapt to the available backend."
msgstr ""
"Pengambilan layar dan kamera bergantung pada layanan sistem operasi, "
"perangkat keras, dan dukungan build. Kontrol di dock menyesuaikan dengan "
"backend yang tersedia."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:303
msgid ""
"**Linux/X11:** Full-screen, window, and numeric region capture are available"
" when the X11 capture backend is built."
msgstr ""
"**Linux/X11:** Pengambilan layar penuh, jendela, dan wilayah numerik "
"tersedia saat backend pengambilan X11 dibangun."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:304
msgid ""
"**Linux/Wayland:** The desktop sharing portal chooses the capture source "
"after recording starts."
msgstr ""
"**Linux/Wayland:** Portal berbagi desktop memilih sumber pengambilan setelah"
" perekaman dimulai."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:305
msgid ""
"**Windows:** Desktop capture uses the available Windows screen backend; "
"camera devices use Windows capture services."
msgstr ""
"**Windows:** Pengambilan desktop menggunakan backend layar Windows yang "
"tersedia; perangkat kamera menggunakan layanan pengambilan Windows."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:306
msgid ""
"**macOS:** Screen capture uses the supported macOS backend, with window and "
"region choices represented as cropped screen bounds when required. System "
"Audio recording is not currently supported; microphone recording remains "
"available as a separate audio source."
msgstr ""
"**macOS:** Pengambilan layar menggunakan backend macOS yang didukung, dengan"
" pilihan jendela dan wilayah yang direpresentasikan sebagai batas layar yang"
" dipotong jika diperlukan. Perekaman Audio Sistem saat ini tidak didukung; "
"perekaman mikrofon tetap tersedia sebagai sumber audio terpisah."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:310
msgid ""
"The first recording may trigger Screen Recording, Microphone, Camera, or "
"desktop-sharing permission prompts. Approve the requested source, then "
"restart OpenShot if the operating system requires it. A disabled source card"
" or option is preferable to a recording that silently omits an unsupported "
"source."
msgstr ""
"Perekaman pertama mungkin memicu permintaan izin Perekaman Layar, Mikrofon, "
"Kamera, atau berbagi desktop. Setujui sumber yang diminta, lalu mulai ulang "
"OpenShot jika sistem operasi memerlukannya. Kartu sumber atau opsi yang "
"dinonaktifkan lebih baik daripada perekaman yang diam-diam menghilangkan "
"sumber yang tidak didukung."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:315
msgid "Troubleshooting Recording"
msgstr "Pemecahan Masalah Perekaman"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:317
msgid "Common recording problems"
msgstr "Masalah perekaman umum"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:321
msgid "Problem"
msgstr "Masalah"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:321
msgid "What to Check"
msgstr "Yang Perlu Diperiksa"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:323
msgid "Mic meter does not move"
msgstr "Meter mikrofon tidak bergerak"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:323
msgid ""
"Select the correct Input, verify OS microphone permission, and check "
"mute/gain."
msgstr ""
"Pilih Input yang benar, verifikasi izin mikrofon OS, dan periksa "
"mute/peningkatan."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:324
msgid "Mic clips or distorts"
msgstr "Mikrofon terpotong atau terdistorsi"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:324
msgid "Lower hardware/input gain and keep peaks below full scale."
msgstr ""
"Turunkan gain perangkat keras/input dan jaga puncak di bawah skala penuh."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:325
msgid "Mic is very quiet"
msgstr "Mikrofon sangat pelan"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:325
msgid ""
"Raise input gain near the device; timeline waveform height does not change "
"audio."
msgstr ""
"Tingkatkan gain input dekat perangkat; tinggi gelombang waktu tidak mengubah"
" audio."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:326
msgid "System Audio is disabled"
msgstr "Audio Sistem dinonaktifkan"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:326
msgid ""
"The active screen backend/build does not support it; check platform audio "
"routing."
msgstr ""
"Backend/build layar aktif tidak mendukungnya; periksa pengaturan rute audio "
"platform."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:327
msgid "System Audio is silent"
msgstr "Audio Sistem tidak bersuara"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:327
msgid ""
"Play audio before testing, verify the output device, and inspect OS "
"privacy/routing."
msgstr ""
"Putar audio sebelum pengujian, verifikasi perangkat keluaran, dan periksa "
"privasi/rute OS."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:328
msgid "Voice contains game echo"
msgstr "Suara mengandung gema permainan"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:328
msgid "Use headphones so the mic does not capture speaker playback."
msgstr "Gunakan headphone agar mikrofon tidak menangkap suara speaker."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:329
msgid "Screen source is incorrect"
msgstr "Sumber layar salah"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:329
msgid ""
"Re-select Full Screen/Window/Region; on Wayland, choose again in the portal."
msgstr ""
"Pilih ulang Layar Penuh/Jendela/Wilayah; di Wayland, pilih lagi di portal."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:330
msgid "Cursor missing on Windows"
msgstr "Kursor hilang di Windows"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:330
msgid ""
"High-DPI scaling can affect the pointer overlay; try the target display at "
"100%."
msgstr ""
"Skala DPI tinggi dapat memengaruhi overlay penunjuk; coba tampilan target "
"pada 100%."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:331
msgid "Webcam is unavailable"
msgstr "Webcam tidak tersedia"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:331
msgid ""
"Check camera permission, close other camera apps, and reconnect the device."
msgstr ""
"Periksa izin kamera, tutup aplikasi kamera lain, dan sambungkan kembali "
"perangkat."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:332
msgid "Recording is choppy"
msgstr "Perekaman tersendat-sendat"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:332
msgid ""
"Lower screen/camera FPS or resolution and close CPU-intensive applications."
msgstr ""
"Turunkan FPS atau resolusi layar/kamera dan tutup aplikasi yang membebani "
"CPU."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:333
msgid "Clips appear on wrong track"
msgstr "Klip muncul di trek yang salah"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:333
msgid ""
"Choose the top destination Track before recording, then move clips if "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"Pilih Trek tujuan teratas sebelum merekam, lalu pindahkan klip jika perlu."

#: ../doc/recording.rst:337
msgid "After Recording"
msgstr "Setelah Perekaman"

#: ../doc/recording.rst:339
msgid ""
"Recorded clips behave like imported media. You can trim, slice, move, mute, "
"fade, add effects, and adjust volume or layout with the standard editing "
"tools. Useful next topics are:"
msgstr ""
"Klip yang direkam berperilaku seperti media yang diimpor. Anda dapat "
"memotong, membelah, memindahkan, membisukan, memudar, menambahkan efek, dan "
"menyesuaikan volume atau tata letak dengan alat pengeditan standar. Topik "
"berikut yang berguna adalah:"

